{"key":"Passives_Abnormality-walpu10.json|/dataList/4/desc","kr_sha":"a673f761ff1a617d7a0acde6edb8eda2d3659c5e6340bb6d67eb50d8fa877d2c","zh":"回合開始時，使速度值最快的友方單位獲得2層 [ParryingResultUp]\n- 若速度值相同，則依菲利普、薩爾瓦多、尤娜的順序給予\n\n<color=#ff6000><mark color=#ff000040><b><u>若自身的現存體力不高於30%，</color></mark></b></u>則同陣營友方單位的3技能命中時，對該目標敵方單位使用「<noparse>聯手</noparse>」 (每回合最多1次)","origin":"claude","since":"raw-20261112","rules":"ebbb490ca56d41c7d99dcd8496ccaee19a55063e","model":"claude-opus-5-5","batch":"20261112T040339-98008681"}
