{"key":"Passives_Abnormality-walpu10.json|/dataList/15/desc","kr_sha":"69a479bafb0014ae1213ede6967cf02316804b095d2310c9a5932f670d339562","zh":"滿足以下任一條件時，使自身獲得1層 [WalpuTenBattleFieldKnow] (每回合最多1次)\n- 戰鬥中有敵人死亡或陷入混亂狀態時\n- <color=#ff6000><mark color=#ff000040><b><u>攻擊命中擁有不低於4種負面效果的目標時</color></mark></b></u>\n- 攻擊命中擁有 [WalpuTenWedgeMarkSilver] 的目標時\n\n以突刺技能的最後一枚硬幣命中時，對主要目標施加1層 [WalpuTenWedgeMarkGold] (每個技能最多1次)","origin":"claude","since":"raw-20261112","rules":"ebbb490ca56d41c7d99dcd8496ccaee19a55063e","model":"claude-opus-5-5","batch":"20261112T040613-dc076fdf"}
